  "content": "Sakala vijjaṃ vidhura jāṇaṃ, deva rūpaṃ sujīvaṃ.Vimalacakkhu gambhira ghoṃsaṃ, gaura vaṇṇaṃ sūkāyaṃ.Abhaya cittaṃ nibhaya kāmaṃ, sūrata dhammaṃ supemaṃ.Virata rajjaṃ sūjana netaṃ, bodhisattaṃ sarāmi.Bodhisattaṃ sarāmi, Bodhisattaṃ sarāmi.",
